  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 803.06 Conversions. The tax imposed by RSA 78-B shall not apply to the conversion of a business entity to a different form of organization pursuant to RSA 78-B:2, XXI.\n\nSource. #10882, eff 7-11-15; ss by #12495, eff 3-21-18; ss by 14071, eff 9-10-24",
